pageType: table_of_contents
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: pageTitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 50, 400, 50]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      text: |
        <p>目录</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: titleLine
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 60, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: col1Number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 200, 340, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 60
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      color: "rgba(124,58,237,0.3)"
      text: |
        <p>01</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col1Title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 290, 340, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 26
      text: |
        <p>市场痛点</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col1Desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 340, 340, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$textMuted"
      text: |
        <p>中小企业经营分析的现实困境：数据沉睡、分析滞后、决策盲目</p>
  - elementId: col1Line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 450, 340, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}
  - elementId: col2Number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 200, 340, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 60
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      color: "rgba(124,58,237,0.3)"
      text: |
        <p>02</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col2Title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 290, 340, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 26
      text: |
        <p>数观解决方案</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col2Desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 340, 340, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$textMuted"
      text: |
        <p>从数据到决策的一站式AI闭环：识别、计算、分析、对话</p>
  - elementId: col2Line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [470, 450, 340, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}
  - elementId: col3Number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 200, 340, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 60
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      color: "rgba(124,58,237,0.3)"
      text: |
        <p>03</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col3Title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 290, 340, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 26
      text: |
        <p>未来展望</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: col3Desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 340, 340, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$textMuted"
      text: |
        <p>构建企业经营智能的基础设施：工具 → 平台 → 生态</p>
  - elementId: col3Line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [880, 450, 340, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}
  - elementId: bottomLine
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 680, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}